			"hadithnumber": 3597,
			"arabicnumber": 3597,
			"text": "It was narrated that ‘Abdullah bin ‘Umar said:“The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) came out to us, and in one of his hands was a garment of silk and in the other was some gold. He said: ‘These are forbidden to the males of my nation and permitted to the females.’”",
